{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32427","headline":"二月十五日樱桃盛开自所居蹑履吟翫竞名王泽章洋才 · 温庭筠","name":"二月十五日樱桃盛开自所居蹑履吟翫竞名王泽章洋才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓觉笼烟重，春深染雪轻。\n静应留得蝶，繁欲不胜莺。\n影乱晨飙急，香多夜雨晴。\n似将千万恨，西北爲卿卿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32427.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32427","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}